      "upstream": "authentication/OpenAPISpec.yaml",
      "spec": "authentication.yaml",
      "package": "authentication",
      "packageName": "@epcc-sdk/authentication",
      "shopperJoin": true,
      "divergence": "keep-list",
      "note": "Not a copy of canonical. Canonical inlines its request and response bodies and defines only Errors; this spec names AccessTokenRequest, AccessTokenResponse, ErrorResponse and Error, which consumers import. The shapes are identical, so this is a naming divergence, not an API one. Kept deliberately in #545; see specs/patches/README.md."
