      "divergence": "none",
      "note": "one spec, two surfaces: the 16 /catalog/* shopper-view operations go to the shopper join, the 30 admin /catalogs* ones to the catalogs package. catalogs@v1 in config/redocly.yaml selects the admin half and prefixes it with /pcm, which canonical does not record."
